OL,3,GNEWSAChampion kayaker complains of
OL,4,Ahuman waste in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FA British kayaker and nine-time world
OL,7,Fchampion says she's "disgusted" and at
OL,8,F"breaking point" over pollution after
OL,9,Fbeing surrounded by human faeces on the
OL,10,FRiver Trent.
OL,12,FOttilie Robinson-Shaw was at the
OL,13,FNational Water Sports Centre in
OL,14,FNottingham earlier this month when she
OL,15,Ffound herself paddling through waste
OL,16,Fand toilet paper and then watched it
OL,17,Fcontinue past for about 30 minutes.
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,369,360,200,160,0,100
