OL,3,GNEWSAChampion kayaker complains of
OL,4,Ahuman waste in river
OL,5,
OL,6,FHer comments come after renewed
OL,7,Fconcerns over water quality in the
OL,8,Friver, which supplies the sports
OL,9,Fcentre, led to questions being asked in
OL,10,Fparliament.
OL,12,FRobinson-Shaw, who posted video footage
OL,13,Fof the waste on social media, said: "I
OL,14,Fwant to share my passion with other
OL,15,Fpeople but I want it to be safe for
OL,16,Fthem to do so."
OL,23,APub: 11-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
